      "description": "Composant signature : « + », champ qui grandit, envoi rond.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-saisie\"><button class=\"ds-plus\" aria-label=\"Importer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></button><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Nouvelle conversation\" placeholder=\"Colle le message ou la conversation…\"></textarea><button class=\"ds-send\" aria-label=\"Continuer\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-saisie{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px;padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dde1ea);border-radius:26px;background:var(--card,#fff);box-shadow:var(--sh-2,0 8px 24px rgb(16 24 40 / .10));transition:border-color .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}.ds-saisie:focus-within{border-color:var(--brand,#1f3864);box-shadow:var(--sh-2,0 8px 24px rgb(16 24 40 / .10)),0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand,#1f3864) 18%,transparent)}.ds-saisie textarea{flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:44px;max-height:180px;padding:11px 4px;border:0;background:transparent;resize:none;font:inherit;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink,#1b1f2a);outline:none}.ds-saisie textarea::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#5b6475);opacity:1}.ds-plus{flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--panel2,#eceff6);color:var(--ink,#1b1f2a);cursor:pointer}.ds-plus svg{transition:transform .2s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-plus[aria-expanded=true] svg{transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-send{flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-a,#1f3864),var(--accent-b,#3a67b8));color:var(--on-accent,#fff);box-shadow:var(--sh-2,0 8px 24px rgb(16 24 40 / .10))}.ds-send:disabled{background:var(--panel2,#eceff6);color:var(--muted,#5b6475);box-shadow:none;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-plus:focus-visible,.ds-send:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand,#1f3864);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Puce de choix",
