      "description": "Choix de ton ou d'objectif ; active en dégradé d'action.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Poli</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Direct</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:8px}.ds-chip{min-height:44px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dde1ea);background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1b1f2a);font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,background .15s ease}.ds-chip:active{transform:scale(.96)}.ds-chip[aria-pressed=true]{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-a,#1f3864),var(--accent-b,#3a67b8));border-color:transparent;color:var(--on-accent,#fff)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand,#1f3864);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rangée d'exemples",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "suggest-card",
      "description": "Cartes d'exemples défilantes : élément coupé, fondu de 32 px, marge de fin de 40 px.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-suggest\"><button class=\"ds-sc\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 20h20L12 3zM12 10v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg><span>Mon patron menace de me renvoyer</span></button><button class=\"ds-sc\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 5h16v11H8l-4 4z\"/></svg><span>« Tu as disparu ! » : un reproche ?</span></button><button class=\"ds-sc\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V6z\"/></svg><span>« Vous avez gagné » : arnaque ?</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-suggest{display:flex;gap:10px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 40px 4px 16px;scrollbar-width:none;scroll-snap-type:x proximity;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,#000 calc(100% - 32px),transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,#000 calc(100% - 32px),transparent)}.ds-sc{flex:none;width:150px;min-height:92px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dde1ea);border-radius:18px;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--ink,#1b1f2a);font:inherit;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;scroll-snap-align:start;transition:transform .12s ease}.ds-sc svg{color:var(--brand,#1f3864)}.ds-sc:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-sc:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand,#1f3864);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Liste groupée",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "set-row",
      "description": "Groupe de Réglages : titre en casse de phrase, rangées de 56 px.",
      "html": "<section><h2 class=\"ds-gt\">Apparence</h2><div class=\"ds-gl\"><a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-grow\">Thème et couleurs</span><span class=\"ds-val\">Bleu, auto</span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"m9 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-row\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-ico\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 6h14M12 6v13\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-grow\">Police</span><span class=\"ds-val\">Téléphone</span><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"m9 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-gt{margin:0 0 8px 6px;color:var(--muted,#5b6475);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0}.ds-gl{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--line,#dde1ea);border-radius:18px;background:var(--card,#fff);overflow:hidden}.ds-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:56px;padding:8px 14px;color:var(--ink,#1b1f2a);font-size:.97rem;text-decoration:none}.ds-row+.ds-row{border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dde1ea)}.ds-row:active{background:var(--panel2,#eceff6)}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand,#1f3864);outline-offset:-3px}.ds-row>svg{color:var(--muted,#5b6475);flex:none}.ds-ico{flex:none;width:32px;height:32px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:9px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand,#1f3864) 12%,var(--card,#fff));color:var(--brand,#1f3864)}.ds-grow{flex:1}.ds-val{color:var(--muted,#5b6475);font-size:.88rem}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Élément du menu latéral",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "drawer-item",
      "description": "Rangée de 48 px ; page courante en --brand sur --brand à 12 %.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-drawer\" aria-label=\"Navigation principale\"><a class=\"ds-di\" href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 11 12 4l9 7v9H3z\"/></svg>Accueil</a><a class=\"ds-di\" href=\"#\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 6h10M18 6h2M4 18h4M12 18h8\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg>Réglages</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-drawer{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;width:280px;padding:12px;background:var(--card,#fff);border-right:1px solid var(--line,#dde1ea)}.ds-di{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:48px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--ink,#1b1f2a);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}.ds-di svg{color:var(--muted,#5b6475)}.ds-di[aria-current=page]{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand,#1f3864) 12%,transparent);color:var(--brand,#1f3864)}.ds-di[aria-current=page] svg{color:var(--brand,#1f3864)}.ds-di:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--brand,#1f3864);outline-offset:2px}"
    }
